:position-manager-next-token-id"}],"executionOrder":["Validate factory, fixed Ethereum mainnet dependencies, single Ethereum wallet, Solana USDC ATA, salts, expected PoolId and expected PositionManager token ID.","Require the funding wallet allowance to the predicted launcher address to equal exactly 25,500 USDC.","Deploy the fixed-supply HookemonToken with CREATE2 and require its address to sort above mainnet USDC.","Deploy the permission-bit-mined ProgrammableVolumeFeeHookV1 child through target:factory with the launcher as its one-time registrar.","Deploy AutomaticRewardsDistributor, CctpForwardingBridgeAdapter, CycleVault, HookemonTreasuryVesting and HookemonPositionTimelock; bind the bridge adapter to the vault.","Derive the canonical HOOKEMON/USDC PoolKey and PoolId; require the reviewed PoolId and exact next PositionManager token ID.","Pull exactly 25,500 USDC, transfer 10% of HOOKEMON to treasury vesting, and transfer 500 USDC to CycleVault.","Register and initialize exactly one canonical pool with the inclusive 3% hook charge and the reviewed initial price.","Transfer the 90% HOOKEMON allocation and 25,000 USDC to PositionManager and mint the exact full-range canonical position.","Transfer bounded token rounding dust and the exact canonical LP NFT into HookemonPositionTimelock.","Assert all immutable ownership, allocation, allowance, pool, liability, position and zero-terminal-balance postconditions, then emit HookemonLaunched."],"postconditions":["The launcher holds zero HOOKEMON and zero USDC.","The funding allowance is exhausted from exactly 25,500 USDC to zero.","Treasury vesting holds exactly 10% of fixed supply and CycleVault holds exactly 500 USDC.","The exact reviewed PositionManager token ID belongs to the timelock, whose PoolKey-derived PoolId equals the canonical PoolId.","The hook project fee owner is CycleVault, the bridge adapter is bound to CycleVault, and CycleVault references the automatic distributor.","No mutable registrar authority or unallocated token balance remains after construction."],"rollback":"Any constructor failure, including a late PositionManager mint failure or postcondition mismatch, reverts every child deployment, pool mutation, transfer, approval consumption and factory registration in the transaction."},"executablePlanBinding":{"contractName":"HookemonDeploymentPlan","domain":"HookemonDeploymentPlan:v4","requiredBindings":["launchAdapter","launcherSalt","launcherInitCodeHash","expectedAtomicLauncher","canonicalPoolId","expectedPositionTokenId","singlePrivyEthereumWallet","nonzeroSolanaOperatorUsdcAtaAndNftRecipient","exact25000LiquidityAnd500CycleVaultUsdcEconomics"],"sourceId":"source:primary","sourceSha256":"sha256:9a6f4b4362cda96e6ed0d5885001ec1fe1daa89b1ad5367bba6ff8b24a0427dc","sourceUnitName":"packages/contracts/script/HookemonDeploymentPlan.sol"},"fixedMainnetDependencies":[{"address":"0x000000000004444c5dc75cB358380D2e3dE08A90","dependencyId":"dependency:pool-manager"},{"address":"0xbD216513d74C8cf14cf4747E6AaA6420FF64ee9e","dependencyId":"dependency:position-manager"},{"address":"0xA0b86991c6218b36c1d19D4a2e9Eb0cE3606eB48","dependencyId":"dependency:quote-token"},{"address":"0x28b5a0e9C621a5BadaA536219b3a228C8168cf5d","dependencyId":"dependency:token-messenger-v2"}],"internalChildPlans":[{"childId":"child:token","contractName":"HookemonToken","deploymentMode":"launcher-create2","sourceId":"source:primary","sourceSha256":"sha256:711b11a80894c5260edad247523678e11e8d201ca0b23c42242d28035978aa79","sourceUnitName":"packages/contracts/src/HookemonToken.sol"},{"childId":"child:volume-fee-hook","constructorAddressDependencies":["dependency:pool-manager","target:atomic-launcher","dependency:quote-token"],"contractName":"ProgrammableVolumeFeeHookV1","declaredHookPermissions":["afterSwap","afterSwapReturnDelta","beforeInitialize","beforeSwap","beforeSwapReturnDelta"],"deployerTargetId":"target:factory","sourceId":"source:primary","sourceSha256":"sha256:115d6fb7753bfcf651d98b1e67399c1